This documentation repository is based on the idea of Open Executive,
created by SenteLabsAI:

    https://github.com/SenteLabsAI/OpenExecutive

Andrés's fork (Grok specialists read prompts and MBA there;
this repository does not copy those files):

    https://github.com/devandmus/OpenExecutive

Open Executive is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Copyright of that project belongs to its contributors
(see that repository's LICENSE).

What this repository takes from that idea: a council of domain
specialists; one door; a company/portfolio profile; seats defined by
result, owner, inputs, outputs, HITL, and will-not-do; and episodic
decisions that live in writing.

What this repository does not take: application source, prompts,
evals, fixtures (including Halcyon / Meridian / Tandem), MBA markdown
knowledge bases, RAG/vector stores, schedulers, chat-platform bots,
or any FastAPI / Next.js / Fly.io stack. See docs/not-copied.md.
